# Tests for the Knockouts_income module (issue #36)

Run with `clerk test`. GENERATED by a script from `scripts/knockout_income_table.mjs`
and the struct declarations of the merged modules; the cases are listed in the
header of each section. Each knockout case sets just that condition on a clean
return and checks that the combined flag is true and that the list of reasons is
exactly that one reason; the clean return has no reason. A known-bad output
(a flag without a reason, or a reason that did not fire) is rejected by the
exact-list assertions. The module tests (`test_interest`, `test_form_w2s`,
`test_unemployment`, `test_form1099_misc`, `test_form1099_rs`,
`test_social_security`, `test_estimated_payments`, `test_hsa`) already hold one
test per knockout of each merged module; here one representative per module
checks the wiring. Oracle comparison: `make difftest SCOPE=knockouts_income`.

> Using Types
> Using Interest as I
> Using Form_w2s as W
> Using Unemployment as U
> Using Form1099_misc as M
> Using Form1099_rs as RS
> Using Estimated_payments as E
> Using Hsa as H
> Using Knockouts_income as K

## Helper: a clean return

A single filer aged 40 with no W-2, no other form, and one answer per knockout
that is "no". The tests override the `c_...` contexts.

```catala
declaration scope Case:
  context c_interest content list of I.InterestReport
  context c_w2s content list of W.FormW2
  context c_gs content list of U.Form1099G
  context c_miscs content list of M.Form1099Misc
  context c_rs content list of RS.Form1099R
  context c_ss content list of money
  context c_est_paid content boolean
  context c_est_diff content boolean
  context c_has_msa content boolean
  context c_income_sources_supported content boolean
  context c_received_digital_assets content boolean
  context c_has_foreign_accounts content boolean
  context c_made_ira_contributions content boolean
  context c_w2_box15 content boolean
  context c_w2_nyrrta content boolean
  context c_w2_rrta content boolean
  context c_yonkers content boolean
  context c_too_late content boolean
  context c_state content Types.ScopedState
  context c_no_payments content boolean
  f scope K.KnockoutsIncome
  output n_fired content integer
  output unsupported content boolean
  output fired content list of K.KnockoutReason
  output u_interest content boolean
  output u_w2s content boolean
  output u_unemployment content boolean
  output u_misc content boolean
  output u_rs content boolean
  output u_ss content boolean
  output u_ep content boolean
  output u_hsa content boolean
  output u_local content boolean

scope Case:
  definition c_interest equals []
  definition c_w2s equals []
  definition c_gs equals []
  definition c_miscs equals []
  definition c_rs equals []
  definition c_ss equals []
  definition c_est_paid equals false
  definition c_est_diff equals false
  definition c_has_msa equals false
  definition c_income_sources_supported equals true
  definition c_received_digital_assets equals false
  definition c_has_foreign_accounts equals false
  definition c_made_ira_contributions equals false
  definition c_w2_box15 equals false
  definition c_w2_nyrrta equals false
  definition c_w2_rrta equals false
  definition c_yonkers equals false
  definition c_too_late equals false
  definition c_state equals Types.ScopedState.NY
